{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/1.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/BreadChickens_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic chickens and breed them to discover new appearances, mutations, and hidden DNA traits.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/2.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/HatchAndRaise_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay eggs, hatch chicks, and influence their traits by feeding them and using potions. Guide their growth to shape your dream chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/3.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/CraftMagicalPotions_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the alchemy table to create potions that manipulate traits and enhance your breeding strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/4.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795830?t=1749413211","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/613ece84281fa9d863ebce4827c28ee30c39bbe5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749413211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/9cc5c5bdc0108c96493b88fde31db46b5af3b32c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749413211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/9cc5c5bdc0108c96493b88fde31db46b5af3b32c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749413211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/1.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/BreadChickens_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic chickens and breed them to discover new appearances, mutations, and hidden DNA traits.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/2.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/HatchAndRaise_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay eggs, hatch chicks, and influence their traits by feeding them and using potions. Guide their growth to shape your dream chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/3.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/CraftMagicalPotions_eng.png?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the alchemy table to create potions that manipulate traits and enhance your breeding strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/extras/4.gif?t=1749413211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["FireLog Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3343910","name":"Chicken Craft"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795830/8cf0b572c6511d003cd42bc353ad80e5a4983a05/header.jpg?t=1749413211","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Chicken Craft Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 460/Radeon HD 5850/Intel HD 4600 with at least 1024 MB video RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FireLog Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"8 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Chicken Craft is a breeding sim on a fantasy farm-lab. Discover unique breeds, unlock various mutations, brew potions and create your very own chickens!","steam_appid":3795830,"support_info":{"email":"giantdwarfsgames@gmail.com","